exfat_damage_verification.scope:
Explicit exFAT upcase-content damage tolerance with strict allocation/ownership.

Synthetic images only. Valid entry-set checksums and UTF-16 names are retained;
missing name-hash verification never becomes verified path evidence.

estimated_fat_verification.scope:
Explicit FAT contiguous estimates: byte truth, refusal paths and uncertainty.

A structurally unknown fragmented BIN intentionally produces an incorrect guess;
that output must remain labelled estimated and is never counted byte-exact.

